# Local run state from exercising this recipe with
# `core-agent -c .agents/config.json` in this directory.
#
# The live credentials are deliberately NOT listed here. gen-tokens.sh
# writes the bearer table and the token stash under RIG_STATE_DIR
# (${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/gke-platform-agent), outside the repository, because a
# .gitignore entry is a weaker guarantee than a path that was never in
# the checkout: one `git add -f`, one `cp -r` of this directory, one
# archive of the worktree, and an ignored secret has travelled anyway.
.agents/sessions/
.agents/config.hub.local.json
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Plans are written at runtime into the pod's emptyDir; the .gitkeep is
# tracked so the read-only image volume has a mount point for it.
.agents/plans/*
!.agents/plans/.gitkeep
